      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The estate’s curved Art Deco blocks, designed in the 1930s, give Tiong Bahru its unmistakable visual character.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.homejourney.sg/blog/tiong-bahru-heritage-hip-area-guide-homejourney-2026-202602042301",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Tiong Bahru was built in the 1930s by the Singapore Improvement Trust, the colonial government’s housing authority before the HDB.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
