      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2003, twenty pre‑WWII flats were gazetted by the Urban Redevelopment Authority for conservation, preserving the estate’s heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tiong_Bahru",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Tiong Bahru is served by two MRT stations: the namesake Tiong Bahru on the East West line and Havelock on the Thomson‑East Coast line.",
